"description":"BETTERHELP: INSURANCE OPTIONS MAY BE AVAILABLE\nBetterHelp makes it easy to connect with a licensed therapist online, whether you choose self-pay or explore insurance options that may be available. Where insurance options are available, eligible members may access therapy with an average copay of $23 per session.*\n\nAnswer a few questions and get matched with a licensed therapist from our community of over 30,000 based on your needs, preferences, and location.\n\n-------------------------------------------\nWHY BETTERHELP?\n-------------------------------------------\n• Insurance options now available\n• Average copay of $23 per session for eligible members\n• Over 30,000 licensed, accredited, and experienced therapists\n• Match with a therapist based on your needs, preferences, and location\n• Message your therapist anytime\n• Schedule weekly live video or phone sessions\n• Access educational group webinars\n• Choose self-pay or explore insurance options that may be available\n\nPROFESSIONAL SUPPORT, TAILORED TO YOU\nFinding the right therapist can make a meaningful difference. BetterHelp matches you with a licensed therapist who understands where you are and where you want to go. You can message your therapist anytime and schedule live sessions from wherever you are, online. (Please note: when using insurance, certain BetterHelp features may be limited or unavailable, including chat-based sessions, groups/classes, and select self-help tools.)\n\nLICENSED AND TRAINED THERAPISTS\nBetterHelp therapists are licensed professionals with at least 3 years and 1,000 hours of hands-on experience. Our network includes psychologists, marriage and family therapists, clinical social workers, licensed professional counselors, and other similarly credentialed providers. \n\nAll of our therapists hold a Master’s Degree or a Doctoral Degree in their respective fields and have been qualified and certified by their state professional board, having completed the necessary education, exams, training, and practice.\n\nHOW MUCH DOES IT COST?\nBetterHelp now offers more payment options, including insurance options that may be available. Insurance availability, coverage, and cost may vary by state, plan, provider network, therapist availability, and deductible status. Eligible members have an average copay of $23 per session.\n\nNot using insurance? Individual self-pay plans typically range from $70 to $100 per week, billed every 4 weeks, and may vary based on location, preferences, therapist availability, and available discounts. Self-pay memberships include in-app messaging and a weekly live session, and you can cancel at any time.\"", "trackId":995252384, "trackName":"BetterHelp - Therapy", "userRatingCount":150226}]
